            "line": 517,
            "text": "theorem tailWeight_bound (d : TailData) {K : ℝ} (hK : 0 < K) (square : Bool)\n    (X : ℝ) (hX : X ∈ Ioi K) :\n    |tailWeight d K square X| ≤ tailSize d square * (X / K) ^ tailDecay d square"
